// BT-3071: Test fixture — actor with class methods that call `self new` /
// `self new:` from inside a class method. Actors must reject direct
// instantiation via the `self`-send path exactly like the static
// (`ActorSelfNewFixture new`) and dynamic (`perform: #new`) sends do, all
// three raising the identical `instantiation_error` produced by the
// class's own compiled `new/0` / `new/1` (BT-893's `class_self_new` routes
// here rather than through `gen_server:call`, which would deadlock).

Actor subclass: ActorSelfNewFixture
  state: value = 0

  class triggerSelfNew -> Self => self new

  class triggerSelfNewWith: initArgs :: Object -> Self => self new: initArgs

  getValue => self.value
